{"id": "wasserman-rental-income-disclosures", "title": "A Rent Board member omitted 28 income sources from his disclosures", "seconds": 57.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "a0cbc95ac51f0ade", "words": 149, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Rent Board member filed his annual disclosure forms.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.49, "shot": "p00", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Twenty-eight", "missing", "sources"], "sub": "Four annual disclosure forms"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 0.7, 1.08, 1.51, 1.68, 2.08, 2.69]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "They reported income but omitted the names of 28 sources.", "t0": 3.61, "t1": 7.49, "shot": "p01", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "28", "label": "Omitted income sources"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.67, 1.21, 1.43, 1.81, 1.94, 2.27, 2.4, 3.11]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Each met a $10,000 reporting threshold.", "t0": 7.61, "t1": 10.47, "shot": "p02", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "$10,000 reporting threshold", "mark": "$10,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.53, 0.61, 0.88, 1.27, 1.67, 2.15]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The March minutes record a separate recusal and a unanimous denial.", "t0": 10.69, "t1": 14.74, "shot": "review-0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "marchMinutes", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "March 15, 2022", "mark": "March"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.87, 1.23, 1.31, 1.71, 2.46, 2.68, 2.79, 3.44]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In April he stepped aside again. The board returned that case for additional evidence.", "t0": 14.86, "t1": 20.12, "shot": "review-1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "aprilMinutes", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "April 12, 2022", "mark": "April"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.66, 0.77, 1.09, 1.45, 2.34, 2.53, 2.89, 3.31, 3.51, 3.86, 4.04, 4.61]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In a separate appeal, Wasserman identified the property owner as his client.", "t0": 20.24, "t1": 24.45, "shot": "p03", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "recusal", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "Appeal AL220010", "mark": "AL220010"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.25, 0.63, 1.13, 1.77, 2.34, 2.43, 2.91, 3.22, 3.39, 3.55]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "He and another commissioner stepped aside.", "t0": 24.57, "t1": 26.67, "shot": "p04", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "May 2022", "mark": "2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.32, 0.65, 1.21, 1.55]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The four remaining commissioners denied the appeal.", "t0": 26.79, "t1": 29.44, "shot": "p05", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "The appeal was denied", "mark": "denied"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.43, 0.87, 1.53, 1.97, 2.09]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "After investigators contacted him, he amended four years of disclosures.", "t0": 29.56, "t1": 33.99, "shot": "p06", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "forms", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "2019 through 2022", "mark": "2019"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 1.13, 1.82, 2.04, 2.18, 2.66, 3.0, 3.32, 3.42]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "All four filings carry the same March 2024 date.", "t0": 34.11, "t1": 37.79, "shot": "p07", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "cover", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "March 20, 2024", "mark": "2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.54, 1.12, 1.42, 1.52, 1.85, 2.22, 2.58, 3.25]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Ethics Commission assessed $600 for each omitted source.", "t0": 38.01, "t1": 42.38, "shot": "p08", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$600", "label": "Per omitted source"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.6, 1.11, 1.64, 1.99, 2.35, 2.83, 3.03, 3.31, 3.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The total was $16,800.", "t0": 42.5, "t1": 45.39, "shot": "p09", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,800", "label": "Commission assessment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.65, 1.15, 1.64, 1.91, 2.24]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Investigators also checked whether the sources had matters before the Rent Board.", "t0": 45.51, "t1": 49.81, "shot": "p10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Public record", "text": "Pending matters", "mark": "matters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.84, 1.21, 1.56, 1.87, 1.98, 2.46, 2.7, 3.13, 3.51, 3.63, 3.87]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "They found no evidence any of the 28 did during that period.", "t0": 49.93, "t1": 53.51, "shot": "p11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No evidence of pending matters"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.48, 0.69, 1.24, 1.49, 1.58, 1.67, 2.26, 2.52, 2.83, 3.03]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 53.63, "t1": 56.24, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Four annual disclosure forms", "b": "A recusal recorded in the minutes", "o": "A $16,800 disclosure penalty"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "timeline"}